  <!--
    These are exact run-owned service/view references, not mutable input data. The three runners
    must write one configured OntologyJobResultStore for their shared run. FormalVisibleScope
    exposes the same verified corpus read view; its sole non-final member is the lazy reopen cache
    for its already saved source inventory, while all evidence/identity-changing operations return
    a new Corpus. Keep the exception pinned to this field or accessor and detector.
  -->
